  "reflectionText": "Samuel cried to the Lord for Israel at Mizpah, and the Lord answered. He set a stone between Mizpah and Shen, and called its name Ebenezer, saying: the Lord helped us until now. What does it take to set a stone in the ground with the name of the help you have already received written on it for those who come after?"
